Detect metadata issues and persist them in the DB

Usage: audit [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --corrupted              Only run corrupted TPE2 detection
      --orphans                Only run orphan artist detection
      --duplicates             Only run duplicate artist detection
      --missing                Only run missing metadata detection
      --enrichment             Only run enrichment gap detection (BPM, mood, acousticId, MB link, Discogs, Bandcamp, Wikipedia)
      --duplicate-release      Only run duplicate-release detection (same MB releaseId, same title/tracks/duration)
      --mismatched-release-id  Only run mismatched-release-id detection (same MB releaseId, different titles)
  -h, --help                   Print help
